  "scope_findings": [
    "Formal V6 auth profile requires empty JWT, Kubernetes, OIDC and several provider-backed maps; identity MFA and SDK credential owners are excluded.",
    "Formal V6 engine predicate accepts root KV1/KV2, local Transit, TOTP, SSH and PKI satisfying native_local_profile; ordinary child namespaces accept KV1/KV2.",
    "Formal V6 storage rejects nonempty database state and nondefault Raft administration before activation or restore.",
    "These are storage admission boundaries, not a claim that all V5 or adapter implementations are absent."
